hooks.command:
command -v "${CAMOUFOX_CLI:-camoufox}" >/dev/null 2>&1 || exit 0; cat <<'EOF'
{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "additionalContext": "For delegated web browsing, include these instructions in the task: Use the camoufox CLI (via Bash) for ALL web browsing instead of WebSearch/WebFetch. Start the daemon with `camoufox ping >/dev/null 2>&1 || { (camoufox serve >/tmp/camoufox-daemon.log 2>&1 &); sleep 1; }`, reuse an instance from `camoufox list --json` or `camoufox launch ${CAMOUFOX_BIN:+--executable \"$CAMOUFOX_BIN\"} --json`, then `camoufox new-page <inst> --json`, `camoufox navigate <inst> <page> '<url>' --wait-until load --json`, and read with `camoufox text <inst> <page>`. For search use https://duckduckgo.com/?q=<query>. If a command reports an open dialog, run `camoufox dialog <inst> <page> accept|dismiss`. The camoufox-browse skill has the full reference."}}
EOF
